@host=http://127.0.0.1:8080/api

### --- Setup : create enzo + thomas, save tokens ---

### Register Enzo
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "enzo@synkro.fr",
  "password": "PasswordEnzo1234"
}

> {% client.global.set("token_enzo", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Register Thomas
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "thomas@synkro.fr",
  "password": "PasswordThomas1234"
}

> {% client.global.set("token_thomas", response.body.accessToken); %}

### --- Projets ---

### Créer un projet (Enzo) → 201 + ProjectResponse
POST {{host}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token_enzo}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Synkro v1.0",
  "description": "Le meilleur gestionnaire de tâches."
}

> {% client.global.set("projectId", response.body.id); %}

### Lister mes projets → 200 + [ProjectResponse]
GET {{host}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token_enzo}}

### Détail projet → 200 + ProjectDetailResponse
GET {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_enzo}}

### Détail projet (Thomas non-membre) → 403
GET {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_thomas}}

### Update projet (Enzo OWNER) → 200 + ProjectResponse mis à jour
PUT {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_enzo}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Synkro v1.1",
  "description": "Description mise à jour"
}

### Ajouter Thomas comme EDITOR → 201 + ParticipantResponse
POST {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token_enzo}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "thomas@synkro.fr",
  "role": "EDITOR"
}

### Lister membres → 200 + [ParticipantResponse]
GET {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token_enzo}}

### Tenter d'ajouter OWNER directement → 409 Conflict
POST {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token_enzo}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "thomas@synkro.fr",
  "role": "OWNER"
}

### Update role Thomas → VIEWER
PATCH {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token_enzo}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "thomas@synkro.fr",
  "role": "VIEWER"
}

### Lookup d'un projet inexistant → 404
GET {{host}}/projects/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token_enzo}}

### --- Tâches (suite du flow projet) ---

### Créer une tâche → 201 + TaskResponse
POST {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token_enzo}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Faire le front-end",
  "description": "Connecter React avec l'API",
  "dueDate": "2026-06-01T12:00:00",
  "assigneeEmails": ["thomas@synkro.fr"]
}

> {% client.global.set("taskId", response.body.id); %}

### Lister tâches projet → 200 + [TaskResponse]
GET {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token_enzo}}

### Update statut → 200 + TaskResponse
PATCH {{host}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token_enzo}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

### Update détails (PUT) → 200 + TaskResponse
PUT {{host}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_enzo}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Faire le front-end (v2)",
  "description": "Connecter React + composants"
}

### Assigner d'autres membres → 200 + TaskResponse
POST {{host}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{token_enzo}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emails": ["thomas@synkro.fr", "enzo@synkro.fr"]
}

### Thomas (VIEWER après ton PATCH précédent) tente delete → 403
DELETE {{host}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_thomas}}

### Delete tâche (OWNER) → 204
DELETE {{host}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_enzo}}

### PUT projet (Thomas EDITOR) → 200 + ProjectResponse
PUT {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_thomas}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Synkro - Edit by Thomas",
  "description": "Mise à jour par Thomas EDITOR"
}

### PUT projet (Thomas VIEWER) → 403 si tu l'as rebaissé à VIEWER
# (selon l'état de ton flow de tests précédent)
PATCH {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token_enzo}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "thomas@synkro.fr",
  "role": "EDITOR"
}

### Transfer ownership Enzo → Thomas → 200 + ProjectDetailResponse
PATCH {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{token_enzo}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newOwnerEmail": "thomas@synkro.fr"
}

### Vérifier : Thomas est OWNER, Enzo est EDITOR
GET {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token_thomas}}

### Transfer back (Thomas OWNER vers Enzo) pour la suite des tests
PATCH {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{token_thomas}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newOwnerEmail": "enzo@synkro.fr"
}

### Tentative transfer par Enzo (qui n'est plus OWNER... s'il l'est redevenu, ok) → 403 si pas OWNER
PATCH {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{token_thomas}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newOwnerEmail": "thomas@synkro.fr"
}

### Upload avatar projet → 200 + ProjectResponse avec avatarUrl
POST {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{token_enzo}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test-avatar.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< C:\Users\enzog\Desktop\test-avatar.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--

### Login admin Enzo (avec nouveau rôle)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "enzo@synkro.fr",
  "password": "PasswordEnzo1234"
}

> {% client.global.set("token_enzo_admin", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Lister tous les users (admin) → 200 + [UserResponse]
GET {{host}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token_enzo_admin}}

### Tentative en non-admin (token Thomas) → 403
GET {{host}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token_thomas}}

### Changer rôle de Thomas en ADMIN → 200 + UserResponse
PATCH {{host}}/admin/users/cfc43590-33e8-4f00-a9b0-6a85cd7426cf/role
Authorization: Bearer {{token_enzo_admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

